    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRYPTOFANTASY -The Scrolls of Kouga&quot; is a 2D Dot Royal Road JRPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy is reborn in another world after an incident! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He wakes up in a world where &quot;ninjas&quot; are active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcA JRPG with an old-fashioned nostalgic atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The side-view battle screen lets you enjoy the real-time flow of time and tense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The game offers a side-view battle screen that allows you to enjoy real-time battles with a real sense of urgency. . etc. Customize your favorite character freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The unique &quot;Ninjas&quot; are fully voiced and add color to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcFull of challenging elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0After clearing the main storyline, the adventure continues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The game offers a new system, vicious monsters, special dungeons as end content, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bCRYPTOFANTASY -The Book of Kouga-&quot; is a game based on the new IP &quot;CryptoNinja&quot; of the web3 era.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRYPTOFANTASY -The Scrolls of Kouga&quot; is a 2D Dot Royal Road JRPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy is reborn in another world after an incident! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He wakes up in a world where &quot;ninjas&quot; are active.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcA JRPG with an old-fashioned nostalgic atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The side-view battle screen lets you enjoy the real-time flow of time and tense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The game offers a side-view battle screen that allows you to enjoy real-time battles with a real sense of urgency. . etc. Customize your favorite character freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The unique &quot;Ninjas&quot; are fully voiced and add color to the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25bcFull of challenging elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0After clearing the main storyline, the adventure continues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0The game offers a new system, vicious monsters, special dungeons as end content, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bCRYPTOFANTASY -The Book of Kouga-&quot; is a game based on the new IP &quot;CryptoNinja&quot; of the web3 era.</p>",
